This directory contains files that are relevant for development,
as well as additional tests and verifications.
While bsdiff4 itself supports Python 3.7+, some of these programs
may require higher Python versions.


patch.py
    Pure Python implementation of `patch()`.


test_suffix_array.py
    Additional tests and verifications for suffix_array() which are neither
    part of the regular test suite nor part of any bsdiff4 distributions.
